return {
    ["\n请各位认真看看这篇公告！\n我们的老约翰死了，别管你认不认识，有什么奇怪的东西还在老约翰身上！\n我不知道怎么去描述，但是老约翰还会在半夜走动，在没有心跳和呼吸的情况下。\n我们不知道应该找谁，医生还是牧师。\n任何知道或有相关消息的人请来铁十字街东南角，位于中街和金梧桐大道之间。\n如果能让老约翰安睡，将会得到一笔丰厚报酬。"] = "\nEveryone, please take a serious look at this announcement!\nOur Old John is dead. Regardless of whether you know him or not, something strange is still on Old John!\nI don't know how to describe it, but Old John still walks in the middle of the night, without a heartbeat or breathing.\nWe don't know who to look for, a doctor or a priest.\nAnyone who knows or has relevant information, please come to the southeast corner of Iron Cross Street, between Middle Street and Golden Indus Avenue.\nIf you can let Old John sleep in peace, you will receive a generous reward.",
